   ("n2","n1","Douleurs musculaires sous statine","On dose la CK et l'on cherche une autre cause.","ei","c2"),
   ("n3","n2","CK > 10× la limite, urines foncées","On arrête la statine et l'on hospitalise.","ei","c3"),
